Dependency-copy patch for skytable 0.8.12 (experimental, round-3 deep pass).
Layer: client connection state, not Dropwise core.
Apply from the copied crate root with: (cd fix/skytable-0.8.12 && patch -p1 < ../drop-poison.patch).

